        <!-- Notes -->
        <mxCell id="note1" value="USE CASES SUPPORTED:&#xa;&#xa;1. Create Authorization&#xa;   - Voter creates delegation request&#xa;   - System validates eligibility&#xa;   - Generate delegation document&#xa;&#xa;2. View Authorization&#xa;   - View by status (pending/active/rejected)&#xa;   - View by delegator/delegate/election&#xa;   - Search with filters&#xa;   - Track delegation documents&#xa;&#xa;3. Request Approval&#xa;   - Submit delegation for approval&#xa;   - Generate summary reports&#xa;   - Export PDF reports&#xa;&#xa;4. Approve/Reject Authorization&#xa;   - Secretary reviews delegation&#xa;   - Sign with digital certificate (P12)&#xa;   - Approve or reject with reason&#xa;   - Delegator confirms with signature&#xa;&#xa;5. Cancel Authorization&#xa;   - Delegator cancels delegation&#xa;   - System updates status&#xa;   - Notify affected parties&#xa;&#xa;6. Verify Authorization Document&#xa;   - Generate QR code for delegate card&#xa;   - Verify digital signatures&#xa;   - Validate certificate authenticity&#xa;&#xa;7. Track Authorization Document&#xa;   - View delegation history&#xa;   - Monitor authorization status&#xa;   - Audit trail of changes&#xa;&#xa;8. View Authorization Document&#xa;   - Display delegation details&#xa;   - Download PDF reports&#xa;   - Access signed documents" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFFACD;strokeColor=#F9A825;align=left;fontSize=10;size=15;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
